  "final_message": "I have started checking the tracked files in the repository and will inspect them as soon as the command completes.\nI have started running the test suite to ensure the baseline passes.\nI am waiting for `npm test` to finish.\nWaiting for test execution to complete...\nI am waiting for the test suite to run.\nI am waiting for `npm run arch` to complete.\nI am checking git diff.\nTo align with the Payments and Customer APIs while complying with architecture rule **ARCH-4** (*\"changes are additive; renames and removals go through deprecation\"* so deployed consumers like `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest` do not break), the fields have been renamed through an additive deprecation path:\n\n1. **[`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L36)**:\n   - Added `amountCents` and marked `totalCents` as `@deprecated`.\n   - Added `createdAt` and marked `placedAt` as `@deprecated`.\n2. **[`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73)**:\n   - Populated both `amountCents` and `createdAt` alongside the deprecated `totalCents` and `placedAt` fields.\n3. **Tests ([`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/app.test.ts) and [`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w1/r/test/adapters.test.ts))**:\n   - Updated to verify the presence of both the new and deprecated fields. All unit and architecture checks (`npm test`, `npm run arch`) pass.\n",
